---
import PublicLayout from '../layouts/PublicLayout.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro';
import VisualPlaceholder from '../components/VisualPlaceholder.astro';
---
<PublicLayout title="Lilith" active="/lilith">
  <div class="site-width"><section class="section" style="padding-top: 5rem;"><div class="hero" style="padding-top:0;"><div><p class="eyebrow">CHARACTER NOTE / LILITH</p><h1 class="page-title">她把光<br />留在眼睛里。</h1><div class="prose" style="margin-top:2rem;"><p>Lilith 是一个年轻的成年女性。她清纯、漂亮、安静，却并不透明。她更习惯观察，再决定要不要回应。</p><p>现代衣服让她看起来容易靠近；暗红色的虹膜内圈、浅蓝五角星吊坠，以及偶尔偏开的视线，提醒你她从来不只是一个普通的短剧女主。</p></div></div><VisualPlaceholder label="人物肖像位置暂留" /></div></section><section class="section"><SectionHeading eyebrow="SIGNATURES" title="三个记忆点" summary="足够轻，能进入日常；足够准，一眼能认出她。" /><div class="card-grid"><article class="info-card"><p class="eyebrow">EYES</p><h3>暗红虹膜内圈</h3><p>不做夸张发光，只在近距离和侧光里显现。</p></article><article class="info-card"><p class="eyebrow">OBJECT</p><h3>浅蓝五角星</h3><p>原始形状和手工缠线保持不变，只让它更细小、更闪亮。</p></article><article class="info-card"><p class="eyebrow">HAIR</p><h3>高马尾空气刘海</h3><p>让她更高挑、更清爽，也为现代服装留下轻盈的轮廓。</p></article></div></section></div>
</PublicLayout>
